#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""qinda-llm-top: live console for the QindaQt LLM Server (qinda-llm.service).

Shows the loaded model and how it is placed on the machine, live prompt and
generation speed, the slots, recent requests, and CPU, memory, GPU and
network load. In LLM Server mode it runs on tty1 (qinda-llm-monitor.service);
it also works in any terminal, e.g. `ssh qinda qinda-llm-top`.

Keys: m load the other model   u unload   r restart the server
      l log / dashboard        q quit (on tty1 the monitor restarts)
"""

